<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.5 trillion lire auction of a fifth tranche of two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   Aug 31, 1998	Previous</p>
<p>Net Yield		  6.60 pct   vs    7.00 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		7.58 pct   vs    7.99 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  86.85	 vs   86.00</p>
<p>Bids			6.607 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a third tranche of August 31, 1998 Ctzs on September 11.</p>
</text>
